{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53940","headline":"七言美瓜沙僧献款诗二首 一 · 宗茝","name":"七言美瓜沙僧献款诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙漠关河路几程，师能献土远输诚。\n因兹却笑宾熬{下爲火}旅，史籍徒章贡赋名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗茝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}